# Brickers Connect

Full-stack Cloudflare Worker prototype for The Brickers Foundation.

## What this build adds

- Community Blog in the main navigation
- Community post submission form
- JPG / PNG / WebP featured image upload
- Client-side resizing/compression for large images
- In-site submission (no `mailto:` popup)
- Every submission is emailed to `crystal.h@brickersfoundation.org`
- Offer Help submissions use the same backend
- Opportunity submissions and nonprofit profile corrections route into the Community Blog form
- Posts remain moderated: submission does not publish automatically
- `/api/health` endpoint for a quick deployment check

